{"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/Schedule\/run(on:)"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"run"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"on"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"world"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"inout"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule0A0V","text":"World"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Before each system, the world’s change tick advances and its "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"WorldModule\/World\/lastRun"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is set to the tick of that system’s previous run, so filters such as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".changed(Position.self)"},{"type":"text","text":" show the system what changed since then: changes made by the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"systems after it on the previous run and before it on this one, but not its own. A system"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that has not run on this world before sees every component as added and changed. A"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"skipped system has not run: the next time it runs, it sees everything since it last did."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The tick advances once more after the last system, so changes made to the world between","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"runs are newer than every system’s previous run.","type":"text"}]}]}],"secti